{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master the Chakras. Master Yourself.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sheva</i> is a roguelite card-fighting game built around simultaneous decisions. Each turn, you and your opponent choose to <strong>charge, attack, or block</strong> \u2014 and both actions resolve at once.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice carries risk. Attack at the wrong time and you\u2019ll be punished. Block too often and you\u2019ll fall behind. Charge wisely to prepare your next move.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat all seven chakra bosses in a single run to unlock the final confrontation. Fail, and begin again \u2014 smarter, sharper, ready to adapt.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Commit at the Same Time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no reaction turns. Both fighters choose their move simultaneously.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charge</strong> to draw a card. <strong>Attack</strong> to unleash your active cards. <strong>Block</strong> to defend against incoming strikes. Victory comes from reading your opponent and committing under pressure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Conquer the Seven Chakras</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run challenges you to defeat seven distinct chakra bosses. The order you choose shapes the difficulty and the rewards you\u2019ll earn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive them all to reach the final trial.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cards That Shift the Fight</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards do more than deal damage. They strengthen attacks, disrupt your opponent, heal, reflect damage, and alter how turns unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The right card at the right moment can decide the duel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One Life. One Run.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a fresh attempt. Defeat means starting over \u2014 but each attempt deepens your understanding and opens new strategic paths.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face the Final Trial</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance offense, defense, and foresight. Defeat the seven. Reach the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Muladhara","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3337620/3ac03006e10b9939105733d77e75053aa17c5192.jpg"},{"name":"Svadhisthana","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3337620/d1b812f854c67171567b4163e5b979811ec0927c.jpg"},{"name":"Manipura","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3337620/4c0d6ea1010cd743bb1fec1214ec8148e36da55b.jpg"},{"name":"Anahata","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3337620/f051cbaf6a41beef8ae1dc257faf296152888045.jpg"},{"name":"Vishuddha","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3337620/d48ebbd3026f093f35232971b45bbb5adc0f0cdf.jpg"},{"name":"Ajna","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3337620/c438e41474d7dcd7441d85b7da21a3778cf1b9a8.jpg"},{"name":"Sahasrara","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3337620/0033883c33e9f709edc98e667156d7c5094d404d.jpg"},{"name":"Enlightened","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3337620/3263277691a1d6bc3e7f0901636bd6adb06f1fa4.jpg"},{"name":"Potential","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3337620/8021dd7c271e5a1a9f8a8e35e1562b9c45bf3bc3.jpg"},{"name":"Full Potential","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3337620/36b9fb188fa62641248df19684cada750bd45457.jpg"}],"total":28},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3337620?t=1773323650","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337620/123a5f98c64fd9ae353777