you choose shapes the difficulty and the rewards you\u2019ll earn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive them all to reach the final trial.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cards That Shift the Fight</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards do more than deal damage. They strengthen attacks, disrupt your opponent, heal, reflect damage, and alter how turns unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The right card at the right moment can decide the duel.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>One Life. One Run.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a fresh attempt. Defeat means starting over \u2014 but each attempt deepens your understanding and opens new strategic paths.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face the Final Trial</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Balance offense, defense, and foresight. Defeat the seven. Reach the end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready?</p>","developers":["Goldtusks"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337620/6305d33415c40956a2105efd727b966a4eb4a3f6/header.jpg?t=1773323650","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04, Ubuntu 18.04, and CentOS 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> x64 architecture with SSE2 instruction set support<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.2+, Vulkan capable<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mojave 10.14+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel or Apple Silicon, x64 architecture with SSE2<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DX10, DX11, DX12 capa