 fighters act simultaneously. Read your opponent, defeat seven chakra bosses, and survive the run to reach the final trial.","steam_appid":3337620,"support_info":{"email":"goldtusksstudio@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian","type":"game","website":null}